              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.18.12+LEV.18.13+LEV.18.14"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilaw 18.12-14",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Mintalioo ake emasipaisho enkanashe yieyioo lino aashu ene nkanashe papaai lino, amu ore ina naa nkilani itooruo oltung'ani le sotua lo lmarei; naa kenap ninche entorroni enye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Teneboitare oltung'ani enkitok olenkapu lenye, naa kenap ninche eng'oki enye, neye eitu etum nkera. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "LEV.18.16"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ilaw 18.16",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Teneya oltung'ani enkitok olalashe lenye naa embae nemesinya ina netaboluo ninye nkilani olalashe lenye nemetum ninche nkera.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Embung'a naa nkitanapat aainei pooki o nkiguanat aainei pooki, niasiasa ninche paa ore ina kop nariku nanu intae entamany nemelopu intae aitayu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nimipuopuo aasujaa olkerreti leilo orere laaraa nanu te dukuya intae, amu etaasa apa ninche kuna baa pooki naibayie nanu ninche. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kake atiaaka nanu intae, ‘Ijung'ujung'u intae enkop enye, naa kaisho nanu intae metaa eninyi, ina kop naruko kule o naishi.’ Ara nanu Olaitoriani Enkai inyi, otirishua intae aitung'uaa loreren. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Enoto naa entirishu eng'ues nasinyari o enemesinyari, o te motonyi nasinyari o enemesinyari, emindurukie naa ate te ng'ues aashu emotonyi aashu tiae toki naikurtutari te nkop, apa natorishie nanu intae nchere mesinyari. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Entaa intae sinyat te nkaraki nanu; amu ore nanu Olaitoriani naa kara sinyati natirishua intae aitung'uaa iloreren, pee itumutumu aataa ilkulainei.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "LEV 20:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Ore olee aashu enkitok nairorie oltung'ani otua aashu esakutisho neari metua, neari ninche too soito, ore osarge lenye neaku shumata ninche etii.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "LEV.20.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "LEV.20.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
